    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>RevioStar Product Watcher adds a review rating column to the WooCommerce product list.<br />\nAdmins can view ratings using icons, numbers, or both, apply color coding, and click<br />\nratings to open the product reviews page.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> RevioStar Product Watcher</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20plugin%20require%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDoes this plugin require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, WooCommerce must be installed and activated.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20my%20own%20icon%20images%3F\">\nCan I use my own icon images?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can upload a custom icon image from the plugin settings page.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Quickly view and monitor WooCommerce product review scores with customizable icons, colors, and numeric display in the admin product list.",
